WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.840
Luka was attacked by a General Class?

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.590
Yes. He seems to be fine, though.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.930
Did that presence we felt

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.920
have something to do with the attack?

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.600
Yes, most likely.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.080
Luka...

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:22.700
If you know where Luka is,
could you tell me where to find him?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.610
I'm so worried about him...

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:30.920
I'm sorry. Takashiro-sama has instructed me

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.120
to keep you from leaving the mansion.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.160
I see...

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.630
Only I know your pain...

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:48.720
Your uncertainty...

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:52.010
Your loneliness...

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:57.190
If only we could be together forever.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:03.600
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:13.860
I will not betray you!

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:58.830
The Vengeful Pair

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.390
Yes, I understand.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:06.670
It seems Yuki-kuna and
the others have returned.

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.630
I see.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:10.450
Send a message to the Twilight Mansion.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:14.390
Have Hotsuma and Shusei come here.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:16.640
Yes, sir.

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:21.700
All right. I understand.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.940
They're inviting Hotsuma and Shusei.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.210
I see.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.200
It must be starting.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.330
Yeah.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.310
Yuki.

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:53.070
Thank you, Sodom.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.080
Can't sleep?

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.350
You, too, Kuroto-kun?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.720
No, I was just looking at the sky.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:08.970
So far away...

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:11.810
Are you free?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:12.530
Huh?

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:14.600
Do you have free time?

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.540
Oh, yes.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:18.120
Come with me.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.900
Let's see...

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:51.700
Why didn't he come with you?

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:57.760
Kuroto-kun, you don't mind Luka?

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:01.250
He's our ally.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:07.760
Besides, the connection you two
share can never be severed.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:09.910
Isn't that right?

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.970
I had someone like that once.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.730
You mean Senshiro-san?

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:30.140
Did you hear he just became a Zweilt,
in time for this war?

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:31.490
Yes.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:36.070
My previous partner was killed
in battle long ago.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.000
Senshiro is my second partner.

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:56.760
Nine years ago, when I was seven years old...
I was sent to live with...

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.270
Senshiro's grandfather, Master Garan.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.690
Senshiro, Tsubaki. Come here.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.490
This is Horai Kuroto-kun.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:14.530
Starting today, he'll be training with us.

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:18.570
So you're the Horai kid...

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:20.870
I'm Senshiro. Nice to meet you.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:29.620
What? Not even a greeting?
We're just trying to be friendly.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.550
Now, now...

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:32.840
You're acting like fools.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:38.430
I don't have time to play with idiots,
who live in some peaceful world.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:44.670
What did you say?

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.450
Calm down, Tsubaki-chan!

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:49.130
How brave.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:53.360
But you mustn't call family foolish.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:55.240
Family?

00:06:55.240 --> 00:07:00.490
That's right. From today on,
you're part of our family.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.190
That's right, Kuropi.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.180
Who are you calling Kuropi?

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:09.600
You don't like it? I thought
it was pretty good.

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:33.320
Is this a Zweilt's?

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.210
Don't touch it!

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:45.290
Sorry...

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.500
Kuroto.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:01.760
Why not play one game?

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:04.220
I don't have time to play.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:12.610
Kuroto, what are you feeling?
Why do you fight?

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:14.520
That's obvious!

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:20.200
To get revenge on that red-haired man.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:27.120
Kuroto, you mustn't be
consumed by the past.

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:31.790
From the way you treasure that ring,
I know you understand.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:35.440
A person cannot live on his own.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:39.340
Playing is good for you.

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:42.940
You'll have so much fun,
you'll forget everything else.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:45.680
I'm...

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.220
...fine on my own.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:55.980
I don't need anyone.

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:57.820
I don't want anyone.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:16.000
I am alone. I always have
been and always will be.

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.510
You're late!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:26.510
What time do you think it is?
We were worried about you!

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.710
You were waiting for me?

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.220
Of course.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.560
Grandfather and I were both
waiting for you to come home.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:37.690
Come inside.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.440
Check.

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.950
W-Wait.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.610
There is no waiting.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:52.280
You're playing again?
I've been calling you for a while.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:55.270
Kuroto demanded a rematch.

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:59.420
What? I'm just keeping you
company because I have to!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:03.150
I don't understand a thing about shogi.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:06.630
I bet you're happy to finally have
someone to play against.

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:09.250
Forget it. What do you want?

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:14.360
Why don't you have some?
They're from the apprentices.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.820
If I have to...

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.660
You're so cute, Kuroto.

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:34.040
That's exactly what I hate about you!

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:36.960
How could you?

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:42.170
You two make quite a pair.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:47.090
Kuroto, congratulations on your promotion!
Congratulations on your professional debut!

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.140
What is all this?

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:59.430
Why do you always have to be such a brat?

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.900
We did all of this for you.

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:05.340
You mean Senshiro did everything.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.320
I can't take it!

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:13.170
You really want her as your fiancée?

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:18.230
In any case, Grandfather
seems really happy.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.670
He's been bragging to all the neighbors

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:22.880
how his grandson's a professional
shogi player.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.190
We're not even blood relations...

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.730
It doesn't matter.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:31.850
Hey, you two! No secrets!

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.350
Let's take a picture!

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:37.810
I don't need a commemorative photo.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.190
I've been blessed.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.240
Senshiro and Kuroto.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:53.410
Both my grandsons have grown into
young men I can be proud of.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.410
Grandfather.

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.920
What's gotten into you?

00:11:56.340 --> 00:12:01.110
I just wish Kuroto would
call me "grandfather."

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:03.840
What? Never!

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.690
Let's take the picture!

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.390
Senshiro.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.150
I'm going out for a bit.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:25.340
Huh?

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.150
Don't stay out too late.

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:40.390
The sky feels so near!

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:46.210
So this is where you've been
disappearing to.

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:52.080
I always thought I was fine on my own.

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:56.650
Living on my own and fighting on my own...

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.140
I even thought I'd eventually
die on my own.

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:03.140
But...

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:10.120
I don't mind being with you.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:15.370
We're supposed to share, right?

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:18.110
I finally got to see it.

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.380
Your smile.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.380
Are you bitter?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:44.020
Do you hate me?

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.270
Then come and kill me.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:01.150
Do not bore me, Zweilt.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:18.920
Senshiro.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.560
What's wrong, Senshiro? What happened?

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.650
What is this place?

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.820
We made this room, just in case.

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:42.190
Hey, what's that supposed
to mean? Answer me!

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.330
We've been attacked!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:48.670
He's a red-haired Opast,
calling himself Cadenza.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.210
<i>Do you hate me?</i>

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:54.010
<i>Then come and kill me.</i>

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.550
Cadenza!

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:00.390
What are you doing, Senshiro?

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:01.140
I know...

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:06.200
I know he's the Opast who
killed your partner!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.880
Then why stop me?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.770
If we don't do something,
all the members of the dojo will...

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:15.240
Protecting you... Protecting the
Zweilt is our responsibility!

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:20.240
Besides, even if you go to
face him, you'll just die.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.900
Even so, I...

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.960
My life's purpose is to defeat him!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:27.560
Kuroto!

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.090
Let go, Senshiro! Let go!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.370
Let go of me!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.640
Let go! Let go!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.220
Kuroto!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:38.340
Stop, Kuroto!

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:43.170
It is your job to live.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:45.010
Master Garan...

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:48.140
I will place a barrier on this door.

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:52.470
Even an old man like me
can buy enough time

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:55.350
for Takashiro-dono to get here.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.430
Senshiro, the rest is up to you.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.130
Wait... Master!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.140
Wh-What are you doing, Senshiro?

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:09.870
Let go. Let go. Let go!

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:11.710
Master! Master!

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:14.370
Master!

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:23.300
Are you the last defense, old man?

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:35.030
Why...

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.510
Are you two all right?

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:13.920
Cadenza has been banished to Infernus,

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:19.260
but I'm sorry.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:21.530
I didn't make it in time.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.660
Grandfather...

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.130
He protected that door until the very end.

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:53.400
Even among humans,

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:57.690
there are those who manage
such heroic deaths.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.680
Giving his life to protect you two

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.380
must have been this human's
greatest desire.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:26.830
Grandfather...

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:36.630
Kuroto!

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.390
Where are you going?

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:43.440
I shouldn't stay around you.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.030
Why not?

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:51.280
I'm a harbinger of death!
If I hadn't come here,

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:53.490
this never would have happened
to Grandfather.

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.450
Kuroto...

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:00.670
From now on, when you see
my face, you'll remember!

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.110
You'll remember the days you
spent with Grandfather!

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.050
And what happened that night!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:09.900
If you stay with me, you...

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:11.880
You're wrong!

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:16.090
The only one with whom I can
reminisce about my grandfather...

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:22.310
And the only one who understands
my frustration and pain is you.

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:29.950
Make me your partner.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.790
I will become a Zweilt!

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:44.920
After that, he endured incredible pain
and became a Zweilt.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.170
I have caused great unhappiness
for both of the people

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:52.890
who saved me from solitude
and gave me a home.

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:59.700
That's why I don't deserve to be happy.

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:04.190
This will be the last time I play shogi.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:16.140
That ring...

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.240
You're finally able to wear it.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.420
Yes, it's been a long road.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.930
It took four years to make it here.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:33.220
I was finally able to become Kuroto's partner.

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:39.850
I'm sorry, Tsubaki. I...

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:44.190
Are you talking about breaking
off our engagement?

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:49.530
Forget about it. It's just an agreement
our families made, anyway.

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:52.640
You can't be sure of what
would have happened.

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:54.620
Besides,

00:20:56.240 --> 00:20:59.420
I've seen how you two are.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:05.780
Grandfather told me Kuroto
had been living by himself,

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.470
since he lost his other half.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:12.170
I want to see Kuroto smile again.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.010
Kuroto-kun.

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:20.750
I think I understand what Garan-san felt.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:24.480
I'm having a lot of fun playing
shogi with you.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:29.400
Kuroto, do you enjoy shogi?

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.780
Live happily.

00:21:38.510 --> 00:21:45.310
Grandfather, would it be all
right if I wished for that?

00:21:57.590 --> 00:22:00.060
The day of our reunion has finally come,

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:02.920
Zweilt of the Black Sword.

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:37.610
I give up.

00:23:37.610 --> 00:23:39.360
Tsukumo-kun, what's wrong?

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:41.320
Toko-chan scolded me

00:23:41.320 --> 00:23:44.180
for taking candy from a strange woman.

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:44.990
What?

00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:45.950
Was it really so wrong?

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:47.590
Sin and Punishment
and Promise

00:23:47.590 --> 00:23:49.170
P-Probably...
